ZealMail
========

ZealMail is a modified version of Mailflare
(https://github.com/hieunc229/mailflare), Copyright its authors,
licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3 (see LICENSE).

Changes made in this version (2026-11-15):
- Renamed the user-facing product name from "Mailflare" to "ZealMail".
- Removed license-key gating: all Pro and Team features (custom branding,
  unlimited accounts, shared mailboxes, account forwarding) are always enabled
  (src/lib/licenses/service.ts). The Licenses page now states this.
- Added a source-code link and upstream credit in the sidebar footer, as
  required by AGPL section 13 (src/lib/zealmail.ts).
- Removed the self-update workflow that would replace this code with upstream.
- Updated the license-gate tests to match.

The Cloudflare Worker is still named "mailflare" because its bindings,
Email Routing rules and service self-reference depend on that name.
